
[TestRequireObjectParams/invalid-0 - 1]
Diagnostic 1: tooManyParams (1:1 - 1:60)
Message: Function 'two' has 2 parameters.
Help: Use a single object parameter instead, so every call site names what it passes.
   1 | function two(a: number, b: number): number { return a + b; }
     | ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
