[TestRequireObjectParams/invalid-2 - 1]
Diagnostic 1: tooManyParams (1:11 - 1:68)
Message: Method has 2 parameters.
Help: Use a single object parameter instead, so every call site names what it passes.
   1 | class A { public two(a: number, b: number): number { return a + b; } }
     |           ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
